{
  "caveats": [
    "These are index numbers, not wage amounts in rupees, average earnings or the share of workers paid a minimum wage. They do not measure inflation-adjusted purchasing power or compliance with wage rules. The combined index overlaps the worker-class indices and cannot be added to them. The Pocket Book does not provide the weights or detailed occupational coverage.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
